            ("Interest is also the main control in the whole system. When it goes up, borrowing slows, firms hire fewer people and prices rise more slowly. When it goes down, the reverse happens. A person who understands that chain can read almost any financial headline. This chapter lays the chain out link by link, then introduces the bond,", "The rate is what decides whether a debt can be cleared or only kept alive, and it is not the same for everyone. This chapter shows what interest does over time and who is charged the most. It then introduces the bond,"),
